It talks over SSH (the ssh2 library, MIT licence) to the fail2ban-client
command of Fail2Ban (https://github.com/fail2ban/fail2ban, GPL-2.0), which it
runs on the user's server but neither includes nor modifies. The files under
test/fixtures are answers of fail2ban-client 1.1.0 read on a test server, with
documentation addresses (RFC 5737, RFC 3849) only.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
the Fail2Ban project.
